        "params": {
          "text": "MIDI HAMMOND 8-TRACK + LESLIE\n\nFull 8-track MIDI organ setup.\nEach track has its own Pipe Organ\nwith unique drawbar registration.\n\nRouting:\nMIDI (8 tracks) -> 8 Organs\n  -> Mix 1-4 + Mix 5-8\n  -> Main Mix -> Leslie -> Reverb -> Out\n\nTrack 1-4: Upper manual voices\nTrack 5-7: Lower manual voices\nTrack 8: Bass pedals (16'+8')\n\n6 polyphonic voices per track.\n\nTips:\n- Toggle Leslie SLOW/FAST!\n- Drive up for rock organ\n- Load Bach, jazz, gospel MIDI"
